      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-04-25T09:01:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This driver is commonly used for ARM CPUs, as mentioned in the commit log by Daniel, this driver is used by Hikey960/Hikey620 boards, and it also is used by Qualcomm DB410c board and Mediatek 8173 board.  So the ARM CPUidle driver is a common driver for different SoCs based on ARM CPUs, as result Android common tree is a good place to land them.\n\nPlease let me know if have any other question, otherwise I will prepare new patch set according to your suggestion :)",
